WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.022
This query uses ROW_NUMBER within each department.

00:00:03.022 --> 00:00:05.932
Salary descending defines the main order.

00:00:05.932 --> 00:00:10.112
Employee ID breaks exact salary ties deterministically.

00:00:10.112 --> 00:00:14.712
The outer query filters row number less than or equal to two.

00:00:14.712 --> 00:00:17.927
That returns at most two rows per department.

00:00:17.927 --> 00:00:24.397
A CTE gives a name to an intermediate result so a complex query can be read in stages.

00:00:24.397 --> 00:00:32.052
Use it to clarify grain changes and major transformations, not simply to break every two lines into a

00:00:32.052 --> 00:00:38.802
new block. A useful CTE name describes what the rows represent, such as patient_totals or ranked_visits.
